  "construction": "Routing code of Zhang, Chen, Duan, Li, Wei, Hou, Kong, Wu and Guo (arXiv:2606.25330, Table 4) on the torus Z_40 x Z_10, routing sequence v = (1,0),(0,1),(1,0),(1,0),(6,1),(6,1),(6,1),(1,0),(1,0),(0,1),(1,0) and w the time reversal of v. Data qubits at sites (i, j) with i + j even (200 of 400 sites, indexed in row-major order of (i, j)); X syndromes at i odd, j even; Z syndromes at i even, j odd. At step t every X syndrome at r swaps with the data qubit at r + v_t and every Z syndrome with the data qubit at r + w_t (positions mod (40, 10)); a syndrome's check is the set of data qubits it swapped with over the 11 steps, so every check has weight 11. The translation (i, j) -> (i + 1, j + 1) maps the X checks onto the Z checks, so d_X = d_Z and the Z witness is the image of the X witness. Rebuilt from the paper's rule; the paper publishes no matrices.",
